  dayNumber: 3
  briefingText: 'DAY 3 - THE INTERCONNECT MAZE (Certification)

    Focus: copper metallization, diffusion barriers, and plugs.

    Defects in play: Tungsten Plug Voids, Silicide Bridging.

    Tools unlocked: Electron Microscope.

    Plug voids are open circuits - REJECT, no exceptions. Silicide bridges caught
    early can be stripped in the ultrasonic etch - REWORK. Weigh rework cost
    against the shift clock. Pass both gates to certify.'
